    "sections": {
        "description": "The Aster IT Courses theme is a modern, responsive, and professional solution designed for educational institutions, online learning platforms, IT training centers, coding academies, tech institutes, computer courses, software tutorials, programming classes, professional certification programs, e-learning platforms, and online course providers. Ideal for IT course website templates, online learning portals, coding academy layouts, training program showcases, programming class sites, and certification course platforms, this theme offers a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes sections for course catalogs, class schedules, instructor profiles, enrollment options, learning modules, banners, interactive course displays, Call to Action (CTA) buttons, and student testimonials to engage potential learners. Built with clean, optimized, and SEO-friendly code, the theme allows easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to match your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for course payments, Contact Form 7 for inquiries and enrollment forms, and LearnPress for course management and online learning functionality, Aster IT Courses provides a high-performing, professional platform to create, promote, and manage IT education and training programs online."
    },
